{"id": "t090-005", "text": "Duc - works for Okafor Logistics, team lead on the warehouse side, been there about eight years. two kids (girls, 6 and 9), both at the primary on Otley Road. wife is Wei, she's a nurse at St James's, mostly nights. they live out in Horsforth near the park, his parents are just down the street and do a lot of the school runs", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works for Okafor Logistics", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "team lead on the warehouse side", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "been there about eight years", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "girls, 6 and 9", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the primary on Otley Road", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "nurse at St James's", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f8", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly nights", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f9", "type": "FACT", "text": "live out in Horsforth near the park", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f10", "type": "FACT", "text": "just down the street", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "f11", "type": "FACT", "text": "do a lot of the school runs", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r2"}]}
{"id": "t090-012", "text": "Long chat with Kerry over coffee. Her new manager is a nightmare apparently, micromanages everything, wants hourly updates and copies himself into every email. Two people on her team have already handed their notice in. She's thinking about applying elsewhere, maybe going back to the NHS, and she's got a call with a recruiter on Thursday. I should send her that job ad Gemma forwarded me.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nightmare", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "micromanages everything", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants hourly updates", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "copies himself into every email", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking about applying elsewhere", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "maybe going back to the NHS", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "call with a recruiter", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that job ad Gemma forwarded me", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t090-013", "text": "Jack and Nadia are hosting Christmas dinner this year, 25 Dec obviously, said we can come. Their dog Biscuit will be there so warn Mum about the allergy thing", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Christmas dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "25 Dec", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "warn Mum about the allergy thing", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergy", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t090-014", "text": "Abebe says the client meeting with Rossi & Co moved to next Wednesday. he's leading it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "client meeting with Rossi & Co", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
