{"id": "t090-036", "text": "Abebe and his wife Kerry have a holiday cottage in the Lakes, near Keswick, they let it out most of the summer and go up themselves at New Year. Their son Jack is at uni in Durham, second year, studying law, and their daughter Leah is still at home doing her A levels. Abebe is originally from Addis, came over to do his masters.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "holiday cottage in the Lakes, near Keswick", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "let it out", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "most of the summer"}, {"id": "f12", "type": "FACT", "text": "go up themselves", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "New Year"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "at uni in Durham, second year", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "studying law", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p4"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leah", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f8", "type": "FACT", "text": "at home", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p4"}, {"id": "f9", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing her A levels", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p4"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f10", "type": "FACT", "text": "originally from Addis", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f11", "type": "FACT", "text": "came over to do his masters", "fact_type":