{"id": "t090-048", "text": "Got invited to Duc's 30th, Saturday 15th, karaoke place in Chinatown. He wants everyone in 80s fancy dress. Wei (his girlfriend, not the other Wei) is organising, said message her if I need the address. Don't forget to buy a wig", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "30th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday 15th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy a wig", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t090-051", "text": "Bridget Adeyemi from the Okafor account rang this afternoon to say the contract renewal is going to be delayed till January, maybe mid January. She's annoyed with her finance team, they keep losing the paperwork. She's also off for two weeks from Friday, her colleague Mustafa will cover. Let the boss know tomorrow and email Mustafa an intro.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bridget Adeyemi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from the Okafor account", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this afternoon"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "contract renewal", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe mid January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "annoyed", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "from Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "colleague", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Let the boss know", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "email Mustafa an intro", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t090-052", "text": "Jack works nights at the hospital, so don't call before 2pm. Lives with his girlfriend Zoe in Chapel Allerton", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works nights at the hospital", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "don't call before 2pm", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Chapel Allerton", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}]}
